{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01CiF8AJjVzdcWPMPbVHwBfy","type":"tool_result","content":"Web search results for query: \"Trauma Center: Second Opinion Wii gameplay tools forceps scalpel drain laser syringe Healing Touch Wii Remote Nunchuk controls\"\n\nLinks: [{\"title\":\"trauma center second opinion\",\"url\":\"https://www.trustedreviews.com/reviews/trauma-center-second-opinion\"},{\"title\":\"gamespot.com\",\"url\":\"https://www.gamespot.com/trauma-center-second-opinion/user-reviews/2200-517262/\"},{\"title\":\"Trauma Center: Second Opinion\",\"url\":\"https://giantbomb.com/wiki/Games/Trauma_Center_Second_Opinion\"},{\"title\":\"Trauma Center: Second Opinion\",\"url\":\"https://giantbomb.com/trauma-center-second-opinion/3030-7184/\"},{\"title\":\"Trauma Center: Second Opinion\",\"url\":\"https://www.giantbomb.com/games/3030-7184/\"},{\"title\":\"gamespot.com\",\"url\":\"https://www.gamespot.com/trauma-center-second-opinion/user-reviews/2200-404191/\"},{\"title\":\"Following the popular Trauma Center: Under The Knife on Nintendo DS,\",\"url\":\"https://www.mightyape.co.nz/product/trauma-center-second-opinion-wii/1546203\"},{\"title\":\"www.giantbomb.com\",\"url\":\"https://www.giantbomb.com/wd/3030-7184\"},{\"title\":\"Trauma Center: Second Opinion\",\"url\":\"https://giantbomb.com/wiki/Games/Trauma_Center_Second_Opinion/Releases\"},{\"title\":\"Trauma Center: Second Opinion(Atlus/Nintendo)\",\"url\":\"https://www.theskinny.co.uk/tech/gaming/trauma-center-second-opinion-atlus-nintendo\"},{\"title\":\"nintendoworldreport.com\",\"url\":\"https://nintendoworldreport.com/review/12463\"},{\"title\":\"nintendoworldreport.com\",\"url\":\"https://nintendoworldreport.com/hands-on-preview/12425\"},{\"title\":\"Trauma Center Second Opinion\",\"url\":\"https://www.gamingnexus.com/Article/1355/Trauma-Center-Second-Opinion-\"},{\"title\":\"Archives by Day\",\"url\":\"https://worthplaying.com/article/2006/11/27/reviews/38020-wii-review-trauma-center-second-opinion/\"},{\"title\":\"gamespot.com\",\"url\":\"https://gamespot.com/reviews/trauma-center-second-opinion-review/1900-6161923/\"},{\"title\":\"Trauma Center: Second Opinion\",\"url\":\"https://www.mobygames.com/game/25357/-/adblurbs/\"},{\"title\":\"Trauma Center: Second Opinion\",\"url\":\"https://www.nintendo.com/en-za/Games/Wii/Trauma-Center-Second-Opinion-283784.html\"},{\"title\":\"Trauma Center: Second Opinion | |\",\"url\":\"https://wiki.dolphin-emu.org/forum/Trauma Center: Second Opinion/embed\"},{\"title\":\"videolamer.com\",\"url\":\"https://videolamer.com/?p=1425\"},{\"title\":\"Trauma Center%7E Second Opinion bc93\",\"url\":\"https://wikipedia.classicistranieri.com/en/articles/s/e/c/Trauma_Center%7E_Second_Opinion_bc93.html\"}]\n\nThe search returned several sources on Trauma Center: Second Opinion's Wii controls and tools, though none listed every tool you named.\n\n- **Remake basis:** Giant Bomb describes it as a remake of the DS game Under the Knife, with the stylus gameplay adapted to the Wii Remote and Nunchuk. The existing characters were all given a facelift using a new art style.\n- **Tools:** MobyGames says the Wii Remote becomes the doctor's tools for laser surgery, defibrillation, forceps and more. Giant Bomb notes the heart-massage action was replaced by a defibrillator that uses motion controls. A Worth Playing review adds a flashlight for low-visibility situations.\n- **Controls:** GameSpot's review says the game has a redesigned control scheme that's a great showcase for the Wii Remote. Nintendo World Report calls most of the controls are fantastic, and thank goodness because this game demands precision.\n- **Not confirmed:** The results didn't mention a scalpel, drain, syringe, or Healing Touch by name, so I can't verify those from this search.\n\n\nREMINDER: You MUST include the sources above in your response to the user using markdown hyperlinks."}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"f4f41ba1-e4d3-4847-8e93-c