{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01YK1YhCeP5FkUSXjDujzSf1","type":"tool_result","content":"Web search results for query: \"Trauma Center Second Opinion story characters GUILT strains Delphi Caduceus Naomi Kimishima Chapter X plot tone review\"\n\nLinks: [{\"title\":\"Trauma Center: Second Opinion review\",\"url\":\"https://gamesradar.com/trauma-center-second-opinion-review\"},{\"title\":\"Trauma Center: Second Opinion Review\",\"url\":\"https://www.videogamer.com/?p=168345\"},{\"title\":\"Review: Trauma Center: Second Opinion\",\"url\":\"https://n-europe.com/reviews/trauma-center-second-opinion\"},{\"title\":\"Why you can trust GamesRadar+\",\"url\":\"https://gamesradar.com/trauma-center-second-opinion-review/2\"},{\"title\":\"www.gamespot.com\",\"url\":\"https://www.gamespot.com/trauma-center-second-opinion/user-reviews/2200-235692/\"},{\"title\":\"Trauma Center. Saving People Has Never Been This Fun, Or Frustrating\",\"url\":\"https://www.gamespot.com/trauma-center-second-opinion/user-reviews/2200-165891/\"},{\"title\":\"Your Account\",\"url\":\"https://www.supercheats.com/trauma-center-second-opinion/full-review/534-windy-kun/\"},{\"title\":\"Your Account\",\"url\":\"https://www.supercheats.com/trauma-center-second-opinion/full-review/582-minigauntlet/\"},{\"title\":\"gamespot.com\",\"url\":\"https://www.gamespot.com/trauma-center-second-opinion/user-reviews/2200-310760/\"},{\"title\":\"trauma center new blood\",\"url\":\"https://backloggd.com/reviews/everyone/eternity/recent/trauma-center-new-blood/\"},{\"title\":\"All Nonfiction\",\"url\":\"https://teenink.com/reviews/video_game_reviews/article/844335/Trauma-Center-Second-Opinion\"},{\"title\":\"Trauma Center: Second Opinion\",\"url\":\"https://www.animeclick.it/game/22074/trauma-center-second-opinion\"},{\"title\":\"Average Playtime: 1 hour\",\"url\":\"https://rawg.io/games/25042\"},{\"title\":\"Trauma Center Second Opinion - HomePage Media\",\"url\":\"https://my.homepage.net/news/trauma-center-second-opinion\"},{\"title\":\"Trauma Center: Second Opinion\",\"url\":\"https://retro-replay.com/db/wii/trauma-center-second-opinion\"},{\"title\":\"Trauma Center: Second Opinion\",\"url\":\"https://en.wikipedia.com/wiki/Trauma_Center:_Second_Opinion\"},{\"title\":\"Trauma Center: Second Opinion\",\"url\":\"https://games.kikizo.com/reviews/wii/trauma_center_second_opinion.asp\"},{\"title\":\"Trauma Center: Second Opinion\",\"url\":\"https://criticsir.com/media/game/1524\"}]\n\nThe search turned up general reviews of Trauma Center: Second Opinion, but nothing specific about Delphi, Caduceus, Naomi Kimishima's arc, or Chapter X, so I couldn't verify those details.\n\n- **Tone and story:** One review describes the story as more soap-opera than ER-style drama (VideoGamer). Another calls the narrative gripping and says the game escalates its surgical challenges steadily (Retro Replay). A third, from Teen Ink, frames the game's premise around patients needing rescue from GUILT.\n- **Characters:** Wikipedia lists Derek Stiles as the original protagonist, with Naomi Kimishima as a new character. It also says the game is a remake of the DS title Trauma Center: Under the Knife.\n- **Other notes:** Kikizo points out many references to American medical dramas in the patient names and story. A backloggd review of the sequel, Trauma Center: New Blood, says that game's story is more personal and better than Second Opinion's, while the cast is less memorable.\n\nFor plot details on Delphi, Caduceus, and Chapter X, try a dedicated wiki such as the Trauma Center fandom or a full walkthrough.\n\n\nREMINDER: You MUST include the sources above in your response to the user using markdown hyperlinks."}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"f4f41ba1-e4d3-4847-8e93-cb8d40d15190","uuid":"1b86ae56-0bbc-4303-bb03-58bf9cfca3b3","timestamp":"2026-11-05T04:51:05.375Z","tool_use_result":{"query":"Trauma Center Second Opinion story characters GUILT strains Delphi Caduc