w.pressreader.com/usa/the-arizona-republic/20170717/281771334240972\"},{\"title\":\"nejm jw.NA34180\",\"url\":\"https://clinician.nejm.org/nejm-jw.NA34180\"},{\"title\":\"Utah Admin. Code R911-9-600 - Trauma Center Designation Process\",\"url\":\"https://www.law.cornell.edu/regulations/utah/Utah-Admin-Code-R911-9-600\"},{\"title\":\"Trending Topics\",\"url\":\"https://www.ems1.com/medical-clinical/articles/opinion-ems-should-allow-review-of-scoring-TGthMbvMv0qEXdcX\"},{\"title\":\"MyNixOS website logo\",\"url\":\"https://mynixos.com/nixpkgs/package/rPackages.traumar\"},{\"title\":\"www.epistemonikos.org\",\"url\":\"https://www.epistemonikos.org/en/documents/f3c137a9e398640518efaa06bf0aef0d59637fba\"},{\"title\":\"MCH Classified as Level II Trauma Center\",\"url\":\"https://www.docbose.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/03/MCH Classified as Level II Trauma Center.pdf\"},{\"title\":\"www.newtownbee.com\",\"url\":\"https://www.newtownbee.com/?p=136431\"}]\n\nThe search didn't return anything about the video game *Trauma Center: Second Opinion*. Every result was about real-world trauma center designations, such as ACS Level I–IV ratings, Hospital Compare star ratings, and state allocation rules. None of them covers the game's rank system (XS through C), its \"Cool,\" \"Good,\" and \"Bad\" operation ratings, or how vitals, timers, misses, and failures factor in, so I have nothing sourced to report on those.\n\nFor a usable answer, try a more specific query such as \"Trauma Center Second Opinion rank requirements\" or \"Trauma Center Second Opinion wiki,\" or check a fan wiki or gaming FAQ directly. I can search again with one of those if you'd like.\n\n\nREMINDER: You MUST include the sources above in your response to the user using markdown hyperlinks."}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"f4f41ba1-e4d3-4847-8e93-cb8d40d15190","uuid":"d4fa6f80-455e-460f-82ad-eff7868de4ce","timestamp":"2026-11-05T04:51:06.464Z","tool_use_result":{"query":"Trauma Center Second Opinion scor