idden (outside sessions) |\", \"| Pause | Resume, Retry Phase, Restart Operation, Settings, Dev Mode, Quit to Menu. In story scenes: Resume, Skip Scene, Settings, Dev Mode, Quit to Menu. Opens by itself when the tab is hidden (outside sessions) |\")\n\n# rate wording\nsub(\"Keep each copy under 16 messages/s (the limit is 20, burst 40) with one token-bucket\", \"Keep each copy to at most 16 messages/s (the limit is 20, burst 40) with one token-bucket\")\n\n# what the skeleton really tested\nsub(\"A skeleton with this stack (a toon scene, Rapier on the host, its own card, the §14.3 message rates) passed\", \"A skeleton with this stack (a toon scene, Rapier on the host, its own card, snapshots at 10/s with a 1/s keyframe, input at 12/s) passed\")\n\n# tests\nsub(\"- Data lint: every op's kinds, sites, tools and speakers exist; every phase has an objective;\", \"- Data lint: every op's kinds, sites, tools and speakers exist; every phase has an objective; every touchable spawn sits inside the drape window (§3.1);\")\nsub(\"- **Bot playthrough on Normal, each operation:** succeeds;\", \"- **Bot playthrough on Normal, each operation (Last Patient has no timer or rank, so it only has to complete):** succeeds;\")\nsub(\"- **Idle:** with no input, each operation fails.\", \"- **Idle:** with no input, each operation except Last Patient fails.\")\nsub(\"using real menu inputs. `state().reached` contains every screen in §8.6.\", \"using real menu inputs. `state().reached` contains Title, Main Menu, Story, Chart, Operation, Report and Credits roll. Other tests here cover Fail, Free Play, Lobby, Settings, About and Touch notice; the hub suite covers the session card.\")\nsub(\"no `TODO`, `FIXME`, `placeholder` or `stub` in source or output, no `Math.random` in `src/sim`,\", \"no `TODO`, `FIXME`, `placeholder` or `stub` in `src/` (search your own source, not the output: the engines' bundled code can contain those words), no `Math.random` in `src/sim`,\")\n\n# research row\nsub(\"|